<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-21T11:30:01.958Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:30:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Kashmir have killed the last known local Lashkar operative and other remaining local terrorists, with Amit Shah repeatedly stating that no local terrorists remain in the valley. In Manipur, security troops are conducting operations after a spurious liquor tragedy that left over 300 hospitalised and 13 dead, while DGP Nalin Prabhat reviews ongoing security actions in the Jammu zone. In Chhattisgarh, security forces recovered arms, ammunition and explosives from Maoist dumps in Dantewada and Kondagaon. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOQ2ZPTzVDWldJOUo1bTR3SllKOUFTOGEtbXYwd19seG92LXFXNFRiQUNKV1JxTHZFbXJhTXM3M3ctUlF0eDcxcW5QcU1EVEcxVHk5RkZpLUpnaHNtWWdwZ0E4a3plYUZUSHpYdzRjOEE1UmZsNGY4dkk4bFB0dU5xb0JaaWVPTTNveGhzTHVGdElmeWZoUUllLU5EWExBN1FLZldETzFaV2xSQjdM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQU3JOUmduTGRQRHVhd0FXdk1QaXd5bTBoU1I2cm40OHI3OGJjZ2thajJOemFxQUxGalpRaWdlY2Y2aF9DRDBPRkZ0UDZNeklRbGRsakp1RC1tRXBkS2pyRE5KRFNhVkpuX0Z4bm1GelNJc2YyS1JfRkswWDZndTBfRUpiREt4Tkx4VC1tMUM1SzFmUHVMeW12ZFdoVGk0NV92dXFfU19OTHk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOVzFEdkZiOVVRTUhDdXpQS0E5clp2d1NiVlBEQThNYTNCaTNVRW5vUmRkU2J5UFRXNzVMSHI5OTRQZkdtRkYzdl9FbTZMcVQwczZaV3pySl9vS1lUQlBtcTQwVEhObXNCTFlweTVUWE1ZZHFxYnVpRjFHYzhZUXdidHdvRnY?oc=5&quot;&gt;kimskashmir.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOMWlYMzZqd2NKUm16bXh0Y01kNEVybk5XRFlOMkJxd1N5eTNySDZiUklvV3M1TXJ6MjRQVzQzTXlLQ1lIWU40TTRNUzlQXzZ0MWNMUVMzNTBUM2ZHN2RsOEFwZkQ1WFYzUXlab2gzRktzTWlFMHM0LUpKSDBZcDM4cVBFbFVFVTNoZmFzUjVjS0JWVlowYWJLU3BFV1Y3cmhTNjRtWWZvTHczc3BORDBoUGhGR3EzUmZlS